{"name":"Emotional","type":"condition","_id":"6mTYXZk95xKrShSz","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>You're feeling a heightened sense of emotions. You suffer a penalty to social and mental tests.</p><p>Upgrades to @UUID[Compendium.wod6e.conditions.Item.SjjvB4L5Si6xdL6x]{Greater Emotional} if you gain a second instance of Emotional.</p>","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"131"},"condition":{"duration":"none","stacks":{"stackable":false,"max":1,"current":1},"bodyPart":"","sourceUuid":"","targetUuid":""},"effects":[{"type":"dice","mode":"subtract","valueSource":"flat","value":1,"targets":["category:social","category:mental"],"predicates":[],"exclusions":[],"valueTrait":""}]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"condition-emotional"}},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.367","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.9","createdTime":1787508082887,"modifiedTime":1787512311413,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Prone","type":"condition","_id":"A06wav3HUCdJVD76","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>You are on the ground, causing you to suffer a penalty to tests to defending yourself from melee physical attacks. However, you gain a bonus to tests to defend yourself from ranged physical attacks.</p>","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"132"},"condition":{"duration":"none","stacks":{"stackable":false,"max":1,"current":1},"bodyPart":"","sourceUuid":"","targetUuid":""},"effects":[{"type":"dice","mode":"subtract","valueSource":"flat","value":1,"targets":[],"predicates":[],"exclusions":[],"valueTrait":""},{"type":"dice","mode":"add","valueSource":"flat","value":1,"targets":[],"predicates":[],"exclusions":[],"valueTrait":""}]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"condition-prone"}},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.367","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.10","createdTime":1787509849946,"modifiedTime":1787513563387,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Scared","type":"condition","_id":"GafTyCxLNR4KKemO","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>You fear for your safety, causing you to suffer a penalty to target the source of your fear with offensive tests. However, you gain a bonus to tests that help you escape or hide from the source of your fear.</p><p>Upgrades to @UUID[Compendium.wod6e.conditions.Item.VNbHioiAFZuWpFSq]{Terrified} if you gain a second instance of Scared.</p>","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"132"},"condition":{"duration":"none","stacks":{"stackable":false,"max":1,"current":1},"bodyPart":"","sourceUuid":"","targetUuid":""},"effects":[{"type":"dice","mode":"subtract","valueSource":"flat","value":1,"targets":[],"predicates":[],"exclusions":[],"valueTrait":""},{"type":"dice","mode":"add","valueSource":"flat","value":1,"targets":[],"predicates":[],"exclusions":[],"valueTrait":""}]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"condition-scared"}},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.367","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.9","createdTime":1787509888879,"modifiedTime":1787512460040,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Tired","type":"condition","_id":"IJWDeLlM1NZPw3Ld","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>You don't have much energy. You suffer a penalty to physical tests.</p><p>Upgrades to @UUID[Compendium.wod6e.conditions.Item.oA0zi0b3h0FWNuTS]{Exhausted} if you gain a second instance of Tired.</p>","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"132"},"condition":{"duration":"none","stacks":{"stackable":false,"max":1,"current":1},"bodyPart":"","sourceUuid":"","targetUuid":"","hasBodyPart":false},"effects":[{"type":"dice","mode":"subtract","valueSource":"flat","value":1,"targets":["category:physical"],"predicates":[],"exclusions":[],"valueTrait":""}]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"condition-tired"}},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.367","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.9","createdTime":1787510547031,"modifiedTime":1787512583653,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Held","type":"condition","_id":"QxixAp9eR9bN8ix4","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Something is limiting your movement. You can't move, and suffer penalties to physical tests.</p>","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"131"},"condition":{"duration":"none","stacks":{"stackable":false,"max":1,"current":1},"bodyPart":"","sourceUuid":"","targetUuid":""},"effects":[{"type":"dice","mode":"subtract","valueSource":"flat","value":1,"targets":["category:physical"],"predicates":[],"exclusions":[],"valueTrait":""}]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"condition-held"}},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.367","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.9","createdTime":1787509512912,"modifiedTime":1787512189737,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Greater Emotional","type":"condition","_id":"SjjvB4L5Si6xdL6x","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Your emotions influence everything you do. You suffer great penalties to social and mental tests, and lesser penalties to physical tests.</p>","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"131"},"condition":{"duration":"none","stacks":{"stackable":false,"max":1,"current":1},"bodyPart":"","sourceUuid":"","targetUuid":""},"effects":[{"type":"dice","targets":["category:physical"],"mode":"subtract","value":2,"valueSource":"flat","valueTrait":"","predicates":[],"exclusions":[]},{"type":"dice","targets":["category:social","category:mental"],"mode":"subtract","value":2,"valueSource":"flat","valueTrait":"","predicates":[],"exclusions":[]}]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"condition-greater-emotional"}},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.367","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.9","createdTime":1787508290271,"modifiedTime":1787512153781,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Paralyzed","type":"condition","_id":"TQ4GZehTjljUOME3","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>You are prevented from moving in a way that affects even your muscles. You can't move, speak, or take any action that requires moving or speaking.</p><p>Additionally, the base difficulty of physical attacks against you have a base difficulty of 0</p>","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"132"},"condition":{"duration":"none","stacks":{"stackable":false,"max":1,"current":1},"bodyPart":"","sourceUuid":"","targetUuid":""},"effects":[]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"condition-paralyzed"}},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.367","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.9","createdTime":1787509806267,"modifiedTime":1787512306547,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Surprised","type":"condition","_id":"Uzqa3t5asyXb5lTZ","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>You're caught off guard - you can't move or act, and you suffer a penalty to all tests.</p>","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"132"},"condition":{"duration":"none","stacks":{"stackable":false,"max":1,"current":1},"bodyPart":"","sourceUuid":"","targetUuid":""},"effects":[{"type":"dice","mode":"subtract","valueSource":"flat","value":2,"targets":["category:physical","category:social","category:mental"],"predicates":[],"exclusions":[],"valueTrait":""}]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"condition-surprised"}},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.367","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.9","createdTime":1787510455876,"modifiedTime":1787512683252,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Immobilized","type":"condition","_id":"V4xXH1HYdEGB1Dtj","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>You're bound in place - unable to move. You can't move, and suffer great penalties to physical tests. You suffer lesser penalties to all other tests.</p>","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"131"},"condition":{"duration":"none","stacks":{"stackable":false,"max":1,"current":1},"bodyPart":"","sourceUuid":"","targetUuid":""},"effects":[{"type":"dice","mode":"subtract","valueSource":"flat","value":2,"targets":["category:physical"],"predicates":[],"exclusions":[],"valueTrait":""},{"type":"dice","mode":"subtract","valueSource":"flat","value":1,"targets":["category:social","category:mental"],"predicates":[],"exclusions":[],"valueTrait":""}]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"condition-immobilized"}},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.367","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.9","createdTime":1787509629081,"modifiedTime":1787512215347,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Terrified","type":"condition","_id":"VNbHioiAFZuWpFSq","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Overcome with fear, you can only try to escape your fear. You can't act offensively towards the source of your fear, and you gain a bonus to escape or hide from the source of your fear.</p><p>Additionally, you can't end your turn within Medium distance of your fear if you can help it.</p>","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"132"},"condition":{"duration":"none","stacks":{"stackable":false,"max":1,"current":1},"bodyPart":"","sourceUuid":"","targetUuid":""},"effects":[{"type":"dice","mode":"add","valueSource":"flat","value":2,"targets":[],"predicates":[],"exclusions":[],"valueTrait":""}]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"condition-terrified"}},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.367","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.9","createdTime":1787509922495,"modifiedTime":1787512556197,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Mangled","type":"condition","_id":"jKc9V1Wg9lGEUtaD","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Your limb was damaged, causing you to suffer a penalty to all tests that use the targeted limb.</p>","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"131"},"condition":{"duration":"none","stacks":{"stackable":false,"max":1,"current":1},"bodyPart":"","sourceUuid":"","targetUuid":"","hasBodyPart":true},"effects":[{"type":"dice","mode":"subtract","valueSource":"flat","value":2,"targets":[],"predicates":[],"exclusions":[],"valueTrait":""}]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"condition-mangled"}},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.367","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.9","createdTime":1787509720913,"modifiedTime":1787512251597,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"name":"Exhausted","type":"condition","_id":"oA0zi0b3h0FWNuTS","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Your limbs can't find the energy to move effectively, and neither can your mind. You suffer great penalties to physical tests, and lesser penalties to mental and social tests.</p>","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"131"},"condition":{"duration":"none","stacks":{"stackable":false,"max":1,"current":1},"bodyPart":"","sourceUuid":"","targetUuid":""},"effects":[{"type":"dice","mode":"subtract","valueSource":"flat","value":2,"targets":["category:physical"],"predicates":[],"exclusions":[],"valueTrait":""},{"type":"dice","mode":"subtract","valueSource":"flat","value":1,"targets":["category:social","category:mental"],"predicates":[],"exclusions":[],"valueTrait":""}]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"condition-exhausted"}},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.367","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.9","createdTime":1787509031121,"modifiedTime":1787512097434,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
